aalTemple\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_MurderTribunal_MapBhaalTemple\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">4bedc6ee-5ea8-4dde-afa8-356b336aa254</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4bedc6ee-5ea8-4dde-afa8-356b336aa254\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4bedc6ee-5ea8-4dde-afa8-356b336aa254\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Looted from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok_Anchev\" title=\"Sarevok Anchev\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/25px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/38px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/50px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sarevok Anchev\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/25px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok_Anchev\" title=\"Sarevok Anchev\">Sarevok Anchev</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Murder_Tribunal\" title=\"Murder Tribunal\">Murder Tribunal</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This sketch map shows a dotted line to follow to get to the Bhaal\nTemple. Below the sketch are some instructions. ]\n</p><p><br>\nUse a round street hatch to enter the City Sewers. Proceed\nnorthwest to find your way into the Undercity Ruins. Blood the\nskull to pass the door. Follow the trail of murder to the Bhaal\nTemple Door. Praise Bhaal!\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200233\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1565/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26110/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6527/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936084/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.868      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.868      1 -total\n 48.16%   20.646      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.32%   18.569     17 Template:Trim\n 22.44%    9.619      2 Template:Uid\n 15.65%    6.710      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.85%    5.936      1 Template:PageSeo\n 13.70%    5.872      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.29%    5.696      2 Template:Icon_link\n 12.87%    5.518      2 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:24759-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200233 and revision id 364945. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}